      "target": "Strings/SpecialOrderStrings",
      "key": "Willy_Text",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey there, I'm looking for a big wad o' bug guts. The juicier the better... at least that's what the crabs seem to like... 100 pieces should do the trick.",
