    {
      "target": "Strings/SpecialOrderStrings",
      "key": "Lewis_RE_Text_2",
      "field": null,
      "source": "There's a new beauty craze in Zuzu City... apparently, a lotion made from {Crop:Text} is said to remove wrinkles. ",
      "translation": "Ve městě Zuzu vypukl nový kosmetický trend... pleťové mléko z plodiny „{Crop:Text}“ prý vyhlazuje vrásky. ",
